    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLIND_SITE is a first-person horror game focused on photography mechanics. Players explore dark environments using their camera's flash to navigate and uncover secrets. The flash system serves as both a vital tool and a risk, as it attracts a fast-moving hostile entity that responds to light. The same goes sound, as each thing you do has a ripple effect throughout the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use photography mechanics to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage enemy attention triggered by camera and realistic noise system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid multiple hostile entities with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird story with a couple endings</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLIND_SITE is a first-person horror game focused on photography mechanics. Players explore dark environments using their camera's flash to navigate and uncover secrets. The flash system serves as both a vital tool and a risk, as it attracts a fast-moving hostile entity that responds to light. The same goes sound, as each thing you do has a ripple effect throughout the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use photography mechanics to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage enemy attention triggered by camera and realistic noise system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid multiple hostile entities with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird story with a couple endings</p></li></ul>",
